Nethack is a game. The *primary* purpose of the game is to entertain.
The in-game goal is subservient to that. If there were a case where
the majority of players (or at least the majority of the DevTeam)
preferred rummaging around in the dungeon to ascending, I think the
"primary victory condition" would cease to be ascension. You may make
your own conclusions as to how likely that is :), the point is that
the game design, and the relative importance of the "primary victory
condition", are subject to revision pending the desires and
preferences of the public and / or maintainers thereof.

